Package: [[package.name]]
# Not [[version]]: that is the raw Maven version, and apt compares on this line. This is the reader's version with
# -SNAPSHOT rewritten to ~snapshot.<run>, which sorts below the release rather than above it.
Version: [[reader.package.version]]
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: fuin.org <info@fuin.org>
Homepage: https://github.com/sokar-ai/sokar-build-github
# The native binary links against both; jdeb does not read it to find out. check-linkage holds these floors to it.
Depends: sokar, libc6 (>= [[package.glibc.floor]]), zlib1g (>= 1:[[package.zlib.floor]])
Description: Sokar's build reader for GitHub Actions
 Reads a task's builds on GitHub Actions for Sokar: which runs a pushed commit
 started, how they ended, and the logs of the jobs that failed. Installs into
 /usr/libexec/sokar/builds as 'github', where sokar finds the reader a project
 names with 'builds: { forge: github }'. Nothing needs to be registered.
